{
  "info": {
    "name": "Microservices – Lab 6",
    "description": "CampusConnect microservices: User (:3001), Product (:3002), Order (:3003).\n\nRun the folders in order (Collection Runner works). Folder 01 and 02 store userId / productId in collection variables that folder 03 uses.\n\nFolder 04 needs a manual step: run `docker compose stop user-service` before \"Create order - User Service DOWN\", and `docker compose start user-service` before \"Create order - after recovery\".",
